## Technical Architecture

### Platform Support

| Platform | Min Version | Target |
|----------|-------------|--------|
| iOS | 15.0 | 17.0 |
| Android | 11 (API 30) | 14 (API 34) |
| Tablet | iPad, Android tablets | Full support |

### Technology Stack

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|------------|
| Framework | React Native |
| State Management | Redux Toolkit |
| Navigation | React Navigation |
| Offline Storage | WatermelonDB |
| Networking | Axios + offline queue |
| Push Notifications | Firebase Cloud Messaging |
| Analytics | Amplitude |
| Crash Reporting | Sentry |

### Performance Requirements

| Metric | Requirement |
|--------|-------------|
| Cold Start | <3 seconds |
| Patient Load | <1 second (cached) |
| Task Sync | <2 seconds |
| Offline Switch | <500ms |
| Memory Usage | <200MB |
| Battery (1hr use) | <10% drain |

### Security Requirements

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| Data at Rest | AES-256 encryption |
| Data in Transit | TLS 1.3 |
| Authentication | OAuth 2.0 + biometric |
| Session | 4-hour timeout (configurable) |
| Remote Wipe | MDM integration |
| PHI Handling | No PHI in logs or analytics |

